      "sourceText": "| 概念 | 含义 | 典型情况 |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| 并发（concurrency） | 多个任务在同一段时间内推进 | 单核 CPU 在多个线程之间切换；程序同时等待多个 IO |\n| 并行（parallelism） | 多个任务在同一时刻真正执行 | 多核 CPU 上多个线程同时计算 |",
      "translatedText": "| Concept | Meaning | Typical case |\n|:---|:---|:---|\n| Concurrency | Multiple tasks make progress during the same period of time | A single\\-core CPU switches between multiple threads; a program waits for multiple IOs at the same time |\n| Parallelism | Multiple tasks truly execute at the same instant | Multiple threads compute simultaneously on a multi\\-core CPU |",
